{
  "_purpose": "Canonical NYC-metro city list for the Cold Call Today routine's geo banding. Band 1 (METRO) = any city listed here. Band 2 (REST OF TRI-STATE) = any other city in NY/NJ/CT. Band 3 (OUTSIDE) = PA/MA/MD/DC/VA/NH/RI/DE/ME/VT, hard-capped at 15 of 50.",
  "_why_this_file_exists": "Before 2026-09-11 the run re-derived this mapping from memory each morning, which silently misfiled 9 contacts - including Edison NJ, the town literally named as the Middlesex boundary in CLAUDE.md. Two of them were undialed rollovers that lost their slot. Read this file; do not rebuild the mapping from scratch.",
  "_matching": "Case-insensitive exact match on the contact's `city` field after trimming. Match within the contact's `state` only - name collisions are real and the state disambiguates them (Clifton NJ is metro, Clifton Park NY is not; New Milford NJ is Bergen/metro, New Milford CT is Litchfield/not; Woodbridge NJ is metro, Woodbridge CT is not).",
  "_unknown_city_rule": "If a contact's city is NOT in this list and NOT obviously out of area, do not silently drop it to band 2. Look up its county, classify it against the county rule below, ADD it to this file, and say so in the run summary. The list only stays correct if each run that meets a new town writes it down.",
  "_county_rule": {
    "NY": "5 boroughs; Nassau + Suffolk (Long Island); Westchester; Rockland; Putnam, Orange, Dutchess (lower Hudson Valley). NOT Ulster, Sullivan, Albany, or anything further upstate.",
    "NJ": "Bergen, Hudson, Essex, Passaic, Union, Morris, and Middlesex up to about Edison/New Brunswick. NOT Somerset, Hunterdon, Warren, Mercer, Monmouth, Ocean, or South Jersey.",
    "CT": "Fairfield County only (Greenwich, Stamford, Norwalk, Bridgeport, Danbury and neighbours). NOT New Haven, Hartford, Litchfield, New London."
  },
